{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t九巴表示，九巴一輛路線290A下午近4時，駛至新清水灣道白虹樓時，被一輛載有學生的校巴從後撞及巴士車尾，巴士上4名乘客受傷。九巴已派員慰問傷者，會配合調查。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事件中共有7人受輕傷，包括校巴上兩名學童。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n網上照片顯示，校巴撞向巴士車尾，校巴車頭損毀。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.320325+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:18:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:04.293826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:54.345424+00:00","content_hash":"f29c7781be2aed53c7890016725c10e332fd61347166cac5c9b20ceefb5de2bc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}